Z||000006||fierosound||04-15-2000||11:37 AM||||I mounted my Denon changer on the ceiling.  Easy to chage cartridges, looks good, doesn't overheat, and doesn't stay frozen in winter.  Pictures at  <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierosound" TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/fierosound</A> <p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 04-15-2000).]||||reg||10
